#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:2
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Registre"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:4
msgid ""
"QiliSDK reports what it is doing through `Loguru "
"<https://loguru.readthedocs.io>`_. Logging is configured automatically "
"when the package is imported, and can be adjusted at any time via "
":func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging`."
msgstr ""
"QiliSDK informa del que està fent mitjançant `Loguru "
"<https://loguru.readthedocs.io>`_. El registre es configura automàticament "
"en importar el paquet i es pot ajustar en qualsevol moment mitjançant "
":func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging`."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:8
msgid ""
"By default only messages of level ``WARNING`` and above are shown, and "
"they are written to the console (``stderr``)."
msgstr ""
"Per defecte només es mostren els missatges de nivell ``WARNING`` o superior, "
"i s'escriuen a la consola (``stderr``)."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:11
msgid "Changing the verbosity"
msgstr "Canviar el nivell de detall"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:13
msgid ""
"Call :func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging` with a ``level`` to "
"override the verbosity:"
msgstr ""
"Crida :func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging` amb un ``level`` per "
"sobreescriure el nivell de detall:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:21
msgid ""
"All other options of the configured sinks (format, filter, colours, ...) "
"are preserved, so only the threshold changes. Calling it again replaces "
"the previous configuration, so the last call wins."
msgstr ""
"La resta d'opcions dels sinks configurats (format, filtre, colors, ...) es "
"conserven, de manera que només canvia el llindar. Tornar-la a cridar "
"reemplaça la configuració anterior, així que preval l'última crida."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:25
msgid "Logging to a file"
msgstr "Registre en un fitxer"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:27
msgid "Pass a ``filename`` to copy the console output into a text file:"
msgstr ""
"Passa un ``filename`` per copiar la sortida de la consola en un fitxer de "
"text:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:41
msgid "Logging levels"
msgstr "Nivells de registre"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:43
msgid "QiliSDK uses the standard Loguru levels, each with its own icon:"
msgstr ""
"QiliSDK utilitza els nivells estàndard de Loguru, cadascun amb la seva "
"pròpia icona:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:49
msgid "Level"
msgstr "Nivell"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:50
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Icona"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:51
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Significat"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:52
msgid "``TRACE``"
msgstr "``TRACE``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:53
msgid "🔬"
msgstr "🔬"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:54
msgid "Very detailed information, typically only useful when written to a file."
msgstr ""
"Informació molt detallada, normalment útil només quan s'escriu en un fitxer."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:55
msgid "``DEBUG``"
msgstr "``DEBUG``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:56
msgid "🐞"
msgstr "🐞"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:57
msgid ""
"Information meant for developers, designed to not flood the terminal "
"during a normal workflow."
msgstr ""
"Informació destinada a desenvolupadors, dissenyada per no inundar el "
"terminal durant un flux de treball normal."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:58
msgid "``INFO``"
msgstr "``INFO``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:59
msgid "💡"
msgstr "💡"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:60
msgid ""
"Information meant for users, designed to not flood the terminal during a "
"normal workflow."
msgstr ""
"Informació destinada a usuaris, dissenyada per no inundar el terminal durant "
"un flux de treball normal."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:61
msgid "``SUCCESS``"
msgstr "``SUCCESS``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:62
msgid "✅"
msgstr "✅"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:63
msgid "Messages indicating a successful operation."
msgstr "Missatges que indiquen que una operació s'ha completat correctament."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:64
msgid "``WARNING``"
msgstr "``WARNING``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:65
msgid "🚧"
msgstr "🚧"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:66
msgid ""
"Things worth noting, such as a parameter being ignored. This is the "
"default threshold."
msgstr ""
"Aspectes a tenir en compte, com ara que s'ignori un paràmetre. Aquest és el "
"llindar per defecte."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:67
msgid "``ERROR``"
msgstr "``ERROR``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:68
msgid "❌"
msgstr "❌"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:69
msgid "Errors. Rarely used, since QiliSDK raises exceptions instead."
msgstr ""
"Errors. S'usen poques vegades, ja que QiliSDK llança excepcions en el seu "
"lloc."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:70
msgid "``CRITICAL``"
msgstr "``CRITICAL``"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:71
msgid "💀"
msgstr "💀"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:72
msgid "Critical errors. Rarely used, for the same reason."
msgstr "Errors crítics. S'usen poques vegades, pel mateix motiu."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:75
msgid "Customising the configuration"
msgstr "Personalitzar la configuració"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:77
msgid ""
"The sinks themselves are described in a YAML file. The packaged one lives"
" next to the source of the :mod:`~qilisdk.logging` module, and looks like"
" this:"
msgstr ""
"Els sinks es descriuen en un fitxer YAML. El que ve amb el paquet es troba "
"al costat del codi font del mòdul :mod:`~qilisdk.logging` i té aquest "
"aspecte:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:93
msgid ""
"To use your own file, point the ``QILISDK_LOGGING_CONFIG_PATH`` setting "
"at it before importing QiliSDK."
msgstr ""
"Per usar el teu propi fitxer, apunta l'opció ``QILISDK_LOGGING_CONFIG_PATH`` "
"cap a ell abans d'importar QiliSDK."

